1. She debuted on September 30th. (Verbatim: "was it september end of september september 30th")

2. She is planning a trip to Japan in October. (Verbatim: "and i'm going to japan in october")

3. Her birthday occurs after New Year's, following Christmas and other events. (Verbatim: "and then we have new year's and then we have my birthday")

