1. She is a British VTuber. (Verbatim: "I'm Elias Delaria, British VTuber and now Twitch partner.")
2. She cannot take off her shoes and has "steppies," with her feet never being shown in her model. (Verbatim: "Fun fact, I actually can't take off my shoes. See? You guys actually never see my feet, but I actually have steppies.")
3. She is taller than the members of I-dere and considers herself to be of normal or tall height. (Verbatim: "Can confirm I am taller than all of I-dere. I am the tallest, I'm the tallest, actually.")
4. She is updating her canon height to better reflect her actual height. (Verbatim: "I am actually updating my canon height to be more reflective, mostly for like...")
5. Her hair is long, and her model has detailed rigging, especially for tippy-toe movements. (Verbatim: "You can see my hair is actually quite long." / "There's actually quite a bit of rigging to these, you know?")
6. She has two mascots named Starlings and Stananas (or "Star na na, star ding"). (Verbatim: "I saw there were a bunch of post-it notes to do with the Starlings and the Stananas which are my two mascots.")
7. She sneezes in a distinctive way that people have told her off for in the past. (Verbatim: "It's the sneeze I was always told off for. I'm actually quite used to sneezing and then getting told off.")
8. She cannot play the tuba and jokes about being called a "sock tuba" instead. (Verbatim: "I can't play the tuba, and I'm not a feet tuba. Feet tuba. You want me to play the tuba with my feet? Huh? No, they call me a sock tuba.")
